{"id":"fb57cd4c-dbeb-4a32-84fe-ddb477ba8b1a","createdAt":"2026-10-26T11:48:15.110Z","batchId":"settings_minimax-m3-1-flash-gateway_high","approach":"html","modelId":"minimax-m3.1-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"high"},"presetId":"settings","prompt":"An account settings panel with profile, notifications and privacy sections.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<style>\n  .settings-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:220px minmax(0,1fr);gap:1.25rem;align-items:start}\n  .settings-nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.35rem;position:sticky;top:1rem}\n  .settings-nav button{width:100%;justify-content:flex-start;text-align:left}\n  .settings-nav button[aria-selected=\"true\"]{background:var(--primary,#4f46e5);color:#fff;border-color:transparent}\n  .settings-panel[hidden]{display:none}\n  .settings-actions{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:.6rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border,#e5e7eb);padding-top:1rem;margin-top:1.25rem}\n  .profile-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border,#e5e7eb);margin-bottom:1.25rem}\n  .profile-avatar{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#e0e7ff;color:#3730a3;font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:700}\n  .form-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}\n  .form-grid .full{grid-column:1/-1}\n  .switch-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;padding:.9rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border,#e5e7eb)}\n  .switch-row:last-child{border-bottom:0}\n  .switch-row strong{display:block;margin-bottom:.15rem}\n  .switch-row label.check{white-space:nowrap}\n  .danger-zone{border:1px solid var(--danger,#ef4444);padding:1rem;border-radius:.65rem}\n  .toast{position:fixed;right:1.25rem;bottom:1.25rem;background:#111827;color:#fff;padding:.8rem 1rem;border-radius:.5rem;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.18);z-index:10}\n  .toast[hidden]{display:none}\n  @media(max-width:700px){.settings-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.settings-nav{position:static;flex-direction:row;overflow:auto}.settings-nav button{white-space:nowrap}.form-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.form-grid .full{grid-column:auto}}\n</style>\n\n<main class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <header class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <div>\n      <h1>Account settings</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Manage your profile, notification preferences, and privacy controls.</p>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"settings-grid\">\n    <nav class=\"card settings-nav\" aria-label=\"Settings sections\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" type=\"button\" data-tab=\"profile\" aria-selected=\"true\">Profile</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" type=\"button\" data-tab=\"notifications\" aria-selected=\"false\">Notifications</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" type=\"button\" data-tab=\"privacy\" aria-selected=\"false\">Privacy</button>\n    </nav>\n\n    <div>\n      <section class=\"card stack gap-lg settings-panel\" data-panel=\"profile\">\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <h2 class=\"card-title\">Profile</h2>\n          <p class=\"card-desc\">Update your personal details and how your account appears.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"profile-head\">\n          <div class=\"profile-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">MC</div>\n          <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n            <div>\n              <strong>Maya Chen</strong>\n              <p class=\"muted small\">Product designer</p>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\" type=\"button\" data-action=\"change-avatar\">Change photo</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <form class=\"stack gap-lg\" data-form=\"profile\">\n          <div class=\"form-grid\">\n            <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n              <span>First name</span>\n              <input type=\"text\" name=\"firstName\" value=\"Maya\" autocomplete=\"given-name\">\n            </label>\n            <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n              <span>Last name</span>\n              <input type=\"text\" name=\"lastName\" value=\"Chen\" autocomplete=\"family-name\">\n            </label>\n            <label class=\"stack gap-sm full\">\n              <span>Email address</span>\n              <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" value=\"maya.chen@example.com\" autocomplete=\"email\">\n              <span class=\"small muted\">Used for sign-in and account notifications.</span>\n            </label>\n            <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n              <span>Job title</span>\n              <input type=\"text\" name=\"jobTitle\" value=\"Product designer\">\n            </label>\n            <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n              <span>Time zone</span>\n              <select name=\"timezone\">\n                <option>UTC−08:00 — Pacific Time</option>\n                <option>UTC−05:00 — Eastern Time</option>\n                <option>UTC+00:00 — Greenwich Mean Time</option>\n                <option>UTC+01:00 — Central European Time</option>\n                <option>UTC+08:00 — Singapore Time</option>\n              </select>\n            </label>\n            <label class=\"stack gap-sm full\">\n              <span>Bio</span>\n              <textarea name=\"bio\" rows=\"4\">Designing calm, useful tools for people who do their best work with focus.</textarea>\n              <span class=\"small muted\">A short introduction, up to 160 characters.</span>\n            </label>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"settings-actions\">\n            <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" type=\"reset\">Reset</button>\n            <button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Save changes</button>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"card stack gap-lg settings-panel\" data-panel=\"notifications\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <h2 class=\"card-title\">Notifications</h2>\n          <p class=\"card-desc\">Choose which updates you want to receive and where they are delivered.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <form class=\"stack gap-lg\" data-form=\"notifications\">\n          <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n            <h3>Email notifications</h3>\n            <div class=\"switch-row\">\n              <div>\n                <strong>Product updates</strong>\n                <span class=\"small muted\">News about features, improvements, and release notes.</span>\n              </div>\n              <label class=\"check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"productUpdates\" checked>\n                <span class=\"sr-only\">Product updates</span>\n              </label>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"switch-row\">\n              <div>\n                <strong>Account activity</strong>\n                <span class=\"small muted\">Sign-ins, password changes, and security alerts.</span>\n              </div>\n              <label class=\"check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"accountActivity\" checked>\n                <span class=\"sr-only\">Account activity</span>\n              </label>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"switch-row\">\n              <div>\n                <strong>Weekly digest</strong>\n                <span class=\"small muted\">A summary of your activity every Monday morning.</span>\n              </div>\n              <label class=\"check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"weeklyDigest\">\n                <span class=\"sr-only\">Weekly digest</span>\n              </label>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n            <h3>Push notifications</h3>\n            <div class=\"switch-row\">\n              <div>\n                <strong>Mentions and replies</strong>\n                <span class=\"small muted\">When someone mentions you or responds to your comment.</span>\n              </div>\n              <label class=\"check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"mentions\" checked>\n                <span class=\"sr-only\">Mentions and replies</span>\n              </label>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"switch-row\">\n              <div>\n                <strong>Reminders</strong>\n                <span class=\"small muted\">Upcoming events and tasks assigned to you.</span>\n              </div>\n              <label class=\"check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reminders\" checked>\n                <span class=\"sr-only\">Reminders</span>\n              </label>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"switch-row\">\n              <div>\n                <strong>Tips and recommendations</strong>\n                <span class=\"small muted\">Personalised suggestions based on your activity.</span>\n              </div>\n              <label class=\"check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"recommendations\">\n                <span class=\"sr-only\">Tips and recommendations</span>\n              </label>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"settings-actions\">\n            <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" type=\"reset\">Reset</button>\n            <button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Save preferences</button>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"card stack gap-lg settings-panel\" data-panel=\"privacy\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <h2 class=\"card-title\">Privacy</h2>\n          <p class=\"card-desc\">Control your visibility, data usage, and account access.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <form class=\"stack gap-lg\" data-form=\"privacy\">\n          <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n            <h3>Visibility</h3>\n            <div class=\"switch-row\">\n              <div>\n                <strong>Show profile activity</strong>\n                <span class=\"small muted\">Let others see your recent activity and contributions.</span>\n              </div>\n              <label class=\"check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showActivity\">\n                <span class=\"sr-only\">Show profile activity</span>\n              </label>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"switch-row\">\n              <div>\n                <strong>Discoverable by teammates</strong>\n                <span class=\"small muted\">Allow teammates to find your profile in the directory.</span>\n              </div>\n              <label class=\"check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"discoverable\" checked>\n                <span class=\"sr-only\">Discoverable by teammates</span>\n              </label>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n            <h3>Data and personalization</h3>\n            <div class=\"switch-row\">\n              <div>\n                <strong>Personalized recommendations</strong>\n                <span class=\"small muted\">Use your activity to tailor content and suggestions.</span>\n              </div>\n              <label class=\"check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"personalization\" checked>\n                <span class=\"sr-only\">Personalized recommendations</span>\n              </label>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"switch-row\">\n              <div>\n                <strong>Share anonymous usage data</strong>\n                <span class=\"small muted\">Help improve the product with aggregated, non-identifying data.</span>\n              </div>\n              <label class=\"check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"usageData\" checked>\n                <span class=\"sr-only\">Share anonymous usage data</span>\n              </label>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"danger-zone stack gap-sm\">\n            <h3>Delete account</h3>\n            <p class=\"card-desc\">Permanently remove your account and associated personal data. This action cannot be undone.</p>\n            <div>\n              <button class=\"btn btn-destructive btn-sm\" type=\"button\" data-action=\"delete-account\">Delete account</button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"settings-actions\">\n            <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" type=\"reset\">Reset</button>\n            <button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\">Save privacy settings</button>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</main>\n\n<div class=\"toast\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" hidden></div>\n\n<script>\n  const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('[data-tab]');\n  const panels = document.querySelectorAll('[data-panel]');\n  const toast = document.querySelector('.toast');\n  let toastTimer;\n\n  function showToast(message) {\n    toast.textContent = message;\n    toast.hidden = false;\n    clearTimeout(toastTimer);\n    toastTimer = setTimeout(() => { toast.hidden = true; }, 3200);\n  }\n\n  tabs.forEach(tab => {\n    tab.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      const target = tab.dataset.tab;\n      tabs.forEach(item => item.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(item === tab)));\n      panels.forEach(panel => { panel.hidden = panel.dataset.panel !== target; });\n    });\n  });\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('form[data-form]').forEach(form => {\n    form.addEventListener('submit', event => {\n      event.preventDefault();\n      const section = form.dataset.form;\n      const messages = {\n        profile: 'Profile changes saved.',\n        notifications: 'Notification preferences saved.',\n        privacy: 'Privacy settings saved.'\n      };\n      showToast(messages[section]);\n    });\n  });\n\n  document.querySelector('[data-action=\"change-avatar\"]').addEventListener('click', () => {\n    showToast('Photo upload is ready.');\n  });\n\n  document.querySelector('[data-action=\"delete-account\"]').addEventListener('click', () => {\n    if (confirm('Delete your account? This action cannot be undone.')) {\n      showToast('Account deletion request submitted.');\n    }\n  });\n</script>","deltas":[[4843,"<style>\n  .settings-"],[4878,"grid{display:grid;gr"],[4878,"id-template-columns:"],[4930,"220px minmax(0,1fr);"],[4930,"gap:1.25rem;align-it"],[4998,"ems:start}\n  .settin"],[4998,"gs-nav{display:flex;"],[4999,"flex-direction:colum"],[5013,"n;gap:.35rem;positio"],[5013,"n:sticky;"],[5076,"top:1rem}\n  .setting"],[5076,"s-nav button{width:1"],[5110,"00%;justify-content:"],[5110,"flex-start;text-alig"],[5146,"n:left}\n  .settings-"],[5146,"nav button[aria-sele"],[5252,"cted=\"true\"]{backgro"],[5252,"und:var(--primary,#4f46e"],[5252,"5);color:#fff;border"],[5255,"-color:transparent}\n"],[5302,"  .settings-panel[hi"],[5302,"dden]{display:none}\n"],[5352,"  .settings-actions{"],[5352,"display:flex;justify"],[5407,"-content:flex-end;ga"],[5407,"p:.6rem;border-top:1"],[5492,"px solid var(--borde"],[5492,"r,#e5"],[5492,"e7eb);padding-top:1r"],[5525,"em;margin-top:1.25re"],[5525,"m}\n  .profile-head{d"],[5574,"isplay:flex;align-it"],[5574,"ems:center;gap:1rem;"],[5609,"padding-bottom:1.25r"],[5609,"em;border-bottom:1px"],[5688," solid var(--border,"],[5688,"#e5e7eb);margin"],[5688,"-bottom:1.25rem}\n  ."],[5724,"profile-avatar{width"],[5724,":64px;height:64px;bo"],[5729,"rder-radius:50%;disp"],[5729,"lay:grid;place-items"],[5826,":center;background:#"],[5826,"e0e7ff;color:#3730a3"],[5892,";font-size:1.35"],[5893,"rem;font-weight:700}"],[5927,"\n  .form-grid{displa"],[5927,"y:grid;grid-template"],[5927,"-colum